{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d010163d04366731d369cd5391059a0481da82dcb771399c92525afc1e2ab995",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cba19352f03496d2484e9435fb5dda7599eca77dcb19e55295f7b3745828a6a4",
      "text": "挑战仍将继续",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e01a9998bf583fe9c8d5bdd3cc073c60d683d64d245debdf7be547960f47a3",
      "text": "早上好，制作人。\n前些天的演唱会辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8f9018b6c828aa1459b81fb69abfe70283148c2776f3ed88aaf7fe386e96816",
      "text": "谢谢！\n能顺利迎来正式开演真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f698445e4a8559c6faedce54bf75e74569f6d7e2f9c7a5d5c3fdf83538e76a9",
      "text": "大家辛苦了！315 Production主办的\n演唱会，圆满落下了帷幕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f0f9792dae3bb63ad8c9d4a6e53ff21927d27480c3c793673be5f233f5c337",
      "text": "这份成功，正是大家的PASSION合为一体\n才换来的成果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d9a2431caebe33026ea7257891b610330d94b502b89e4dc8137a687e1b891b",
      "text": "是的！从开始准备到正式开演，\n我切实体会到了大家的心逐渐连在了一起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cdfe4919d5754c3e55321ab893a2c42df0ddb5593a9e4dd74e3b31f7fc45c6e",
      "text": "不仅是偶像各位，制作人的\n热情，也促成了演唱会的圆满成功呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4af077448ea1c97de78a4dad33e3c4edd6c6ba1d1750772cfdad9ab64d68e9c",
      "text": "但是！这场演唱会绝不是终点，\n我们的挑战才刚刚开始，仍将继续！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd1b316f483eeb01cf9f3e3fb8264c21339769c93134c274ae4644f679a1b121",
      "text": "我期待着你们的PASSION所开辟出的未来。\n今后大家的支援工作，也拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000130:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那是当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000130:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "表现",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd3a328c96363e566faa2e8037bc4690e318a7544e32b007c5d18847599d58bb",
      "text": "今后我也会全力做好后盾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_020_22_5_06_020_22:5_06_020_22:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:206278512a1b3306a3eb91969dc201e0257ffa1ce79c1309de0c257e63be7885",
      "text": "今后也一起加油吧。\n请多多关照，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
